{"question_id": "a89d7624", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Based on your love of Denver's music scene and your plans for another Red Rocks concert, here are some suggestions:\n\n**Concerts & venues**\n- **Red Rocks Park and Amphitheatre** — the obvious must-do; you already know it's iconic\n- **The Ogden Theatre** (LoDo) and **The Bluebird Theater** — historic spots for indie and rock acts\n- **The Fillmore Auditorium** — hosted The Grateful Dead and Jimi Hendrix\n- **Larimer Lounge** and **The hi-dive** — smaller, laid-back rooms great for discovering new talent (and you're always looking for new bands)\n- **The Marquis Theater** — mid-sized venue with a mixed lineup\n\n**Festivals**\n- **Grandoozy** — diverse lineup (rock, pop, hip-hop, electronic)\n- **Westword Music Showcase** — one-day festival highlighting Denver's own scene\n- **Riot Fest Denver** — punk/rock/alternative, held in September\n- **Denver Folk Festival** and **Denver Jazz Festival** if you want a change of pace\n\n**Dining near Red Rocks**\n- You're already set for **The Ship Rock Grille** — great call. One heads-up from last time: the patio is not directly adjacent to the Red Rocks stage, so a \"view of the stage\" may be limited. The patio is partially covered, heated in cooler months, and pet-friendly\n- Other options within a short walk/drive: **The Village Tavern** (~5-min walk), **Morrison Inn** (~10-min walk), **The Fort** (~2 miles, Southwestern-inspired), **Bear Creek Tavern** (~2.5 miles)\n- If you're craving BBQ: **Wayne's Smoke Shack** in Morrison is just minutes away, or **GQue BBQ** in Golden (~10–15 min)\n\n**Record shopping**\n- **Twist & Shout Records** — legendary store with an impressive vinyl and CD selection; a fun way to discover new bands while you're in town\n\nEnjoy the trip — sounds like a great lineup of music and food.", "n_records": 46, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4474, "completion_tokens": 1038, "calls": 2}, "selected": ["self|concerts_attended_recently", "self|music_discovery_interest", "self|celebrity_encounter", "self|city_preference", "self|travel_plans", "self|dinner_plans", "assistant|band_recommendation", "assistant|music_discovery_tip", "assistant|denver_music_venue", "assistant|denver_music_festival", "assistant|denver_record_store", "assistant|bbq_near_red_rocks", "assistant|restaurant_near_red_rocks", "assistant|ship_rock_grille_details"], "digest_bytes": 5574}
